# Bug hunt round 1 (trains): he takes the cab, opens the regulator, then shuts it and holds the brake (jump) and the
# train comes to a stand. (Shut alone, it coasts: 14 b/s to 1.4 in 30 s, as a train does.)
stream on
train at station
ride train car 1
print player
expect riding == 1
drive 1 15
print train
expect train.speed > 2
drive 0 1
hold jump 25
print train
expect train.speed < 0.5
expect riding == 1
hold sneak 0.1
tick 1
print player
expect riding == 0
expect player.inblock == 0
